### non-finite-values-are-faults
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 nan
s 2 20
s 3 inf
s 4 20
s 5 -inf
---
cfg
NORMAL
FAULT TO_FAULT@1:nan
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@2:20.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@3:inf
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@4:20.000
FAULT TO_FAULT@5:-inf
### fault-clear-with-zero-delay-two-notes
